        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny Dream Home is a relaxing and engaging game where players transform empty spaces into beautifully styled rooms—one piece of furniture at a time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It blends satisfying puzzle mechanics with the creativity of interior design. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no storyline or time pressure, this game offers a cozy, stress-free escape into the world of home decor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 Objective: Unpack furniture from boxes and place each item in its correct position to complete the room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🖱️ Mechanics: Use intuitive drag-and-drop controls to move and arrange items. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 Challenges: As you progress, layouts become more complex with limited space and a wider variety of furniture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎵 Style: Minimalist visuals, gentle animations, and soothing music create a peaceful, clutter-free experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏡 Multiple Levels: Decorate a wide range of uniquely designed rooms—from cozy bedrooms to modern studios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🪑 Relaxing Gameplay: No timers, scores, or penalties—just calm, satisfying organization at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👩‍🎨 The Joy of Tidying Up: While the layout is fixed, there’s something deeply satisfying about seeing each item click into place as the room transforms from cluttered to complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕹️ Accessible Controls: Simple and easy-to-learn mechanics make the game perfect for players of all skill levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why Play Tiny Dream Home?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a casual gamer, a puzzle fan, or simply someone who finds joy in a tidy, beautiful space, this is your perfect cozy escape. It’s all about the small pleasures—unpacking, placing, arranging—and the satisfying click when everything fits into place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny Dream Home is a relaxing and engaging game where players transform empty spaces into beautifully styled rooms—one piece of furniture at a time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It blends satisfying puzzle mechanics with the creativity of interior design. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no storyline or time pressure, this game offers a cozy, stress-free escape into the world of home decor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 Objective: Unpack furniture from boxes and place each item in its correct position to complete the room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🖱️ Mechanics: Use intuitive drag-and-drop controls to move and arrange items. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 Challenges: As you progress, layouts become more complex with limited space and a wider variety of furniture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎵 Style: Minimalist visuals, gentle animations, and soothing music create a peaceful, clutter-free experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏡 Multiple Levels: Decorate a wide range of uniquely designed rooms—from cozy bedrooms to modern studios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🪑 Relaxing Gameplay: No timers, scores, or penalties—just calm, satisfying organization at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👩‍🎨 The Joy of Tidying Up: While the layout is fixed, there’s something deeply satisfying about seeing each item click into place as the room transforms from cluttered to complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕹️ Accessible Controls: Simple and easy-to-learn mechanics make the game perfect for players of all skill levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why Play Tiny Dream Home?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a casual gamer, a puzzle fan, or simply someone who finds joy in a tidy, beautiful space, this is your perfect cozy escape. It’s all about the small pleasures—unpacking, placing, arranging—and the satisfying click when everything fits into place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
